    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "The first-jet identity uniquely determines W_vee on every clean split fiber. Coefficientwise interpolation over all deg(P_cl) clean slopes fixes W_vee modulo P_cl. Since deg_t W_vee<=deg(P_cl)+1, every corrected square has the unique form W_vee=W_0+P_cl(t A_W+B_W), leaving only two degree-at-most-r-1 univariate correction polynomials.",
